    2135	
    2136	**Statement.** Let `f_N(z) := Σ_{n=2}^{N} χ_P(n) z^n` (length N+1, weight
    2137	M = π(N)). For every rational `a/q` with `(a, q) = 1` and `q ≤ Q`,
